---
const quizUrl = '/breakup-reset/blog/en/should-i-do-no-contact-quiz/';
---

<aside class="quiz-promo feature-callout" aria-labelledby="no-contact-quiz-promo-heading">
  <p class="feature-callout-label">Free quiz</p>
  <h3 id="no-contact-quiz-promo-heading">Should I do no contact?</h3>
  <p>
    Four yes-or-no questions. Works if you share kids, a pet, or a lease, not just
    clean-break situations.
  </p>
  <p class="quiz-promo-action">
    <a href={quizUrl} class="button button-filled button-cta">Take the quiz</a>
  </p>
</aside>
